    "title": "Ribeiro leads No. 14 Madison past Mountain Lakes - Girls soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bob Badders ,\n1 hours ago A goal by junior midfielder Manu Ribeiro in the 15th minute proved to be the game-winner as Madison, No. 14 in the NJ.com Top 20, built a quick lead to defeat Mountain Lakes, 3-1, and remain unbeaten. After junior midfielder Camryn Visich staked the Dodgers (7-0-1) to a 1-0 advantage... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
